    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.phanion.kock1888-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.phanion.kock1888-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_phanion">
        <head>ΦΑΝΙΟΝ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="497" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-497" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_phanion">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-497-l1" xml:lang="grc">οἷα δὴ φιλοῦσιν ἰατροὶ λέγειν</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-497-l2" xml:lang="grc">τὰ φαῦλα μείζω καὶ τὰ δείν’ ὑπέρφοβα,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-497-l3" xml:lang="grc">πυργοῦντες αὐτούς.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Floril. 102, 3 κατὰ ἰατρῶν Μιμνέρμου Νάννου Α.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Μιμνέρμου κατὰ ἰατρῶν Voss. Vind. Μενάνδρου Porson. Φανίου Mein. Mimnermi Nanno distichis conscripta est. 1. ὁποῖα Bergk. et Cobet. Mnem. nov. II 449. 2. ὑπέρφοβα B] ὑπὲρ φόβον. 3. πυργοῦν sic praeter ceteros Euripides. cf. Med. 526. Tro. 608. Herc. fur. 475. Or. 1568. Rhes. 122. — quamquam (ut 499) nequaquam certum est haec ex hac fabula excerpta esse, tamen hic omittere nolui.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="498" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-498" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_phanion">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-498-l1" xml:lang="grc">ὑπελήλυθέν τέ μου</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-498-l2" xml:lang="grc">νάρκα τις ὅλον τὸ δέρμα.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Athenaeus 7, 314 b νάρκη. Μένανδρος δὲ ἐν Φανίῳ (sic Schweigh., φανωι A) διὰ τοῦ α ἔφη κτλ. μηδενὸς τῶν παλαιῶν οὕτω κεχρημένου. et sine fabulae indicio Eustathius 1173, 47 (ὑπελήλυθέ μου).</note>
          <note type="apparatus">ὅλον τὸ δέρμα νάρκα τις Dobr. Adv. II 279. de voce νάρκα cf. Lob. Phryn. 331.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="499" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-499" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_phanion">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-499-l1" xml:lang="grc">ἄνθρωπος ὢν ἥμαρτον· οὐ θαυμαστέον.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Orion Anthologn. 8, 11 Φανιέως.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Φανίου Schneidewin.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="500" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-500" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_phanion">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0541-phanion-500-l1" xml:lang="grc">φειδωλὸς ἦν καὶ μέτριος ἀγοραστής.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Athenaeus 4, 171 a παρὰ Μενάνδρῳ ἐστὶ κοινότερον (ἀγοραστής) ἐν Φανίῳ κτλ. deest ultimus iambus. — ἀγοραστής etiam Xen. Mem. 1, 5, 2.</note>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
